# Insina Health — production environment
#
# PUBLIC CONFIG ONLY — this file is intentionally git-tracked (see the
# !.env.production negation in .gitignore, AUDIT_SEC_02 F-10) because the CI
# build needs it. NEVER put a secret here: anything in this file ships in the
# public repo AND is baked into the client bundle. Real secrets (API keys,
# tokens) live in Render / GitHub environment settings, never in the repo.
#
# Set this to your Render proxy URL after deploying the proxy server.
# See proxy/DEPLOY.md for deployment instructions.
VITE_PROXY_URL=https://insina-health.onrender.com
